-10-03 00:00:00','2022-10-03 00:00:00','<p>Konsultasi Revisi Proposal Penelitian Staf&nbsp;</p>\n'),(12,3,'Rapat Aula Lt. IV','2022-10-26 00:00:00','2022-10-26 00:00:00','<p>Upaya Rumah Sakit Dalam Mencapai Target Pendapatan Tahun Anggaran 2022.</p>\n'),(13,1,'Konsultasi Penelitian','2022-10-05 00:00:00','2022-10-05 00:00:00',''),(14,1,'Konsultasi Penelitian','2022-10-07 00:00:00','2022-10-07 00:00:00',''),(15,1,'Konsultasi Penelitian','2022-10-10 00:00:00','2022-10-10 00:00:00',''),(16,1,'Konsultasi Penelitian','2022-10-12 00:00:00','2022-10-12 00:00:00',''),(17,1,'Konsultasi Penelitian','2022-10-14 00:00:00','2022-10-14 00:00:00',''),(18,3,' Peringatan Hari Kanker Payudara Taman IRJA Lantai I ','2022-10-27 00:00:00','2022-10-27 00:00:00','<p>Peringatan Hari Kanker Payudara (Breast Cancer Day) dan Hari Patology Anatomy Sedunia Tahun 2022</p>\n'),(19,1,'Konsultasi Penelitian','2022-10-17 00:00:00','2022-10-17 00:00:00',''),(20,1,'Konsultasi Penelitian','2022-10-21 00:00:00','2022-10-21 00:00:00',''),(21,1,'Konsultasi Penelitian','2022-10-19 00:00:00','2022-10-19 00:00:00',''),(22,1,'Konsultasi Penelitian','2022-10-24 00:00:00','2022-10-24 00:00:00',''),(23,1,'Konsultasi Penelitian','2022-10-26 00:00:00','2022-10-26 00:00:00',''),(24,2,'Presentasi produk PT. Indolab Artha Medika','2022-11-08 22:00:00','2022-11-08 12:00:00','<p>PT. Indolab Artha Medika Presentasi Produk (Reagen BASO Wright Giemsa Stain &amp; S-Y Liu&rsquo;s Stain Kit), jumlah peserta&nbsp;&plusmn; 21, terdiri dari&nbsp;Koord. Perencanaan, Koord. Anggaran, Koord. Akuntansi, Koord. Pelayanan Penunjang, Tim Teknis PPK Medis, Tim HTA, IPS Medik, Inst. Laboratorium Sentral</p>\n'),(25,2,'Presentasi Produk','2022-11-29 10:00:00','2022-11-29 12:00:00','<p>PT. Global Niaga Persada presentasi dan demo produk&nbsp;Ecomed/ Gorden Anti Microbial Berbahan Polypropilen&nbsp;</p>\n'),(26,1,'Kegiatan Site Assesment  untuk Pengembangan CRU RSUP Dr. M. Djamil Padang','2022-12-20 09:00:00','2022-12-21 12:00:00','<p>Kegi